class:: Cyclegen
summary:: Sequenced-cycle oscillator with a walking waveform
related:: Classes/Gendreve, Classes/Diststoch
categories:: UGens>Generators>Stochastic

description::

A fixed sequence of frequencies sets the pitch, advancing one value per cycle
(or every code::repeats:: cycles). Within each cycle the waveform is a ring of
code::knum:: control points seeded from a template; they can walk, jump, or be
tethered back toward it. code::knum:: and code::freqs:: are fixed at build time.

classmethods::

method:: ar
argument:: knum
Control points per cycle (fixed). Default 8.
argument:: ampStep
Amplitude walk step size (0 = static). Default 0.05.
argument:: ampDist
Distribution: 0 linear, 1 cauchy, 2 logistic, 3 hyperbcos, 4 arcsine, 5 exponential, 6 sinus. Default 0.
argument:: ampDistParam
0–1. Default 0.5.
argument:: ampJump
Walk → memoryless redraw, 0–1. Default 0.
argument:: stiffness
Pull toward the template, 0–1. Default 0.
argument:: templateType
0 sine, 1 saw, 2 triangle, 3 square, 4 flat. Default 0.
argument:: templateSkew
Pulse width, 0–1. Default 0.5.
argument:: freqMul
Transpose multiplier on every frequency. Default 1.
argument:: repeats
Cycles held per sequence value. Default 1.
argument:: seqMode
0 forward, 1 reverse, 2 pingpong, 3 random. Default 0.
argument:: interp
0 hold, 1 linear, 2 cosine. Default 1.
argument:: freqs
Array of frequencies (Hz), fixed at build time. Default code::#[110, 165, 220, 330]::.
argument:: mul
argument:: add

examples::
code::
{ Cyclegen.ar(12, ampStep: 0.08, stiffness: 0.5, templateType: 1, seqMode: 2, freqs: [110, 147, 165, 220]) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Cyclegen.ar(120, ampStep: 0.38, stiffness: 0.05, templateType: 1, seqMode: 2, freqs: [110, 147, 165, 220] * LFNoise0.kr(0.1).range(0.5, 1.5)) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Cyclegen.ar(16, ampStep: MouseX.kr(0, 0.5), stiffness: MouseY.kr(0, 1), templateType: 2, freqs: [220, 293, 330, 440]) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Cyclegen.ar(64, ampStep: 0.25, ampJump: MouseX.kr(0, 1), stiffness: 0.1, templateType: 3, templateSkew: MouseY.kr(0.05, 0.95), freqs: [82, 110, 123, 165]) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Cyclegen.ar(24, ampStep: 0.15, stiffness: 0.3, templateType: 1, repeats: 3, seqMode: 3, freqMul: MouseX.kr(0.5, 2), freqs: [110, 138, 165, 207, 247]) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Cyclegen.ar(8, ampStep: 0.4, ampDist: 1, ampDistParam: 0.2, stiffness: 0.02, interp: 0, freqs: [55, 82, 110, 165, 220, 330]) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Cyclegen.ar(200, ampStep: 0.45, stiffness: 0.03, templateType: 1, seqMode: 2, interp: 2, freqs: [65, 87, 98, 131] * LFNoise0.kr(0.25).range(0.75, 2.0)) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Cyclegen.ar(12, ampStep: 0.1, stiffness: 0.6, templateType: 0, repeats: 2, seqMode: 2, freqs: (Scale.minorPentatonic.degrees + 60).midicps) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;

{ Splay.ar([1, 1.5, 2.02].collect { |m| Cyclegen.ar(32, ampStep: 0.2, stiffness: 0.15, templateType: 1, freqMul: m, seqMode: 2, freqs: [110, 147, 165, 220]) }) * 0.2 }.play;

{ Cyclegen.ar(48, ampStep: 0.3, stiffness: SinOsc.kr(0.05).range(0, 0.8), templateType: 2, seqMode: 2, freqs: [147, 165, 196, 220, 262]) * 0.2 ! 2 }.play;
::
